          "title": "You'll want to know: عمر",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "عمر — umr — \"age\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "میری بہن کی عمر دس سال ہے۔ merī bahan kī umr das sāl hai. My sister is ten years old."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
